#: 628be6e4228142bc9e3da85c2251e5fd
msgid "FPV VTX BEC: 9V/12V 5A (selectable) and controlled by GPIO"
msgstr "FPV VTX BEC：9V/12V 5A（可选），由 GPIO 控制"

