#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:55
#: fcc7fc85a5a54c9585e6ae9f1a022d92
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:56
#: 2b0c097737044189bfa8b3916702798b
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART6 RX input. It supports all "
"unidirectional serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr "RC 输入默认通过 USART6 RX 配置。支持除 PPM 以外的所有单向串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:58
#: bd4fb944299544d7b1b423e948fa44b2
msgid ""
"For FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART6 TX6 pin , "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` set to 3, :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS "
"<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` = \"7\" (invert TX/RX, half duplex)."
msgstr ""
"对于 FPort，接收机必须连接到 USART6 TX6 引脚，:ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 设置为 "
"3，:ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS <SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` = 「7」（TX/RX 反相，半双工）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:59
#: 73ea5c27232a4e51ae0f81a7331ab15f
msgid ""
"For full duplex CRSF/ELRS use both TX6 and RX6, and "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` set to 3 and provides telemetry."
msgstr ""
"对于全双工 CRSF/ELRS，使用 TX6 和 RX6，:ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 设置为 3，并自动提供数传遥测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:61
#: 7474a27ae69443e69eef64788a98e0cf
msgid ""
"If SBUS is used on HD VTX connector (DJI TX), then "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOl<SERIAL1_PROTOCOl>` should be set to \"23\" and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` changed to something else. If "
"UART1 is used for something else, be sure the RX2 pin on the HD VTX "
"connector is left open."
msgstr ""
"若在高清 VTX 连接器（DJI TX）上使用 SBUS，则应将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOl<SERIAL1_PROTOCOl>` "
"设置为 「23」，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 更改为其他值。若 UART1 "
"用于其他用途，请确保高清 VTX 连接器上的 RX2 引脚保持悬空。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:64
#: 94cbe978a6cd48b8b251d9dcff45399b
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:65
#: 684660ff197b4d1582f23c880f535b17
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using an unused UART, such as the T1 pin (UART1"
" transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for "
"FrSky S.PORT:"
msgstr "FrSky 数传通过未使用的 UART 支持，如 T1 引脚（UART1 发送）。需要设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:68
#: beedf23768a54cf1a91b19341b0d9f2d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:69
#: afe35dae0f1846358bc88d277afd076f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:72
#: f43a10d08b904b42af8f822fca0b2c15
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:73
#: 059f611b29154f61bc8dba1411d726e4
msgid ""
"The TBS Lucid H7 Wing supports analog OSD using its onboard MAX7456 and "
"simultaneously DisplayPort using TX3/RX3 on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"TBS Lucid H7 Wing 支持使用板载 MAX7456 的模拟 OSD，同时通过高清 VTX 连接器上的 TX3/RX3 支持 "
"DisplayPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:76
#: f39bd7e712d64899b4c2f8c93deb2e3b
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:77
#: 469f1c2e036f4a989fb2da964dbb4828
msgid ""
"The TBS Lucid H7 Wing supports up to 13 PWM or DShot outputs. The pads for "
"motor output M1 to M4 are provided on both the motor connectors and on "
"separate pads, plus M9-13 on a separate pads for LED strip and other PWM "
"outputs."
msgstr ""
"TBS Lucid H7 Wing 最多支持 13 路 PWM 或 DShot 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 "
"的焊盘同时提供在电机连接器和独立焊盘上，另有 M9–13 的独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带和其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:79
#: 92d17c9c49d14314b2d8d3024b0edf1f
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:81
#: 15b2885ff8334da49df36f8e40fcc1f4
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1–2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:82
#: 6658e57d341648fd8a2cc0532a017db3
msgid "PWM 3-4   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3–4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:83
#: 4a6a6c899a55466895e0c24eddc47aed
msgid "PWM 5-6   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5–6 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:84
#: 7c5cc4a4147b47f79242146ca7f9b0da
msgid "PWM 7-10  in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7–10 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:85
#: 2761ce4dc8154a1da75a1c7e077b1300
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 11–12 在第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:86
#: 8bd5ea9c8eba45bab5dcbf0a408ebf07
msgid "PWM 13    in group6"
msgstr "PWM 13 在第6组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:88
#: 8d27b472c56b41ac85d027007e016c25
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-10 support bi-directional Dshot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道必须使用相同输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1–10 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:93
#: 15f05718d8884a52b9d097890b09de21
