#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:119
#: 6c6d77a738f646459e1b974231440802
msgid ""
"The TBS Lucid H7 Wing does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach "
"an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "TBS Lucid H7 Wing 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:122
#: 8100dc523b5e4ac6befe4ad6a773acbf
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:123
#: 5e8315657753438a9347f5a61eb640c4
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the Vsw pins which can be set to output either VFC (9/12V) "
"or 5V via a board jumper. Setting this GPIO high removes voltage supply to "
"pins. RELAY2 is configured by default to control this GPIO and is low by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制 Vsw 引脚，可通过板上跳线选择输出 VFC（9/12V）或 5V。将此 GPIO 拉高将切断引脚供电。RELAY2 "
"默认配置用于控制此 GPIO，默认为低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:125
#: 61f86411be114c8ca540c959832d9a22
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V/12V\"  included on "
"the HD VTX connector and VFC pads and is included on the HD VTX connector. "
"Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to this pin/pad. By default "
"RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标有 「9V/12V」 的引脚（位于高清 VTX 连接器和 VFC 焊盘上）。将此 GPIO "
"拉低将切断该引脚/焊盘的供电。默认情况下 RELAY4 配置用于控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设为高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:129
#: 9023e1296d4d4b749088a0d4c376dba2
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:130
#: 0d74f6f7e10f42da96c28b5c1ede9486
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"C1\" and "
"\"C2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video input from C1 to C2. By "
"default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制标有 「C1」 和 「C2」 连接器的相机输出。将此 GPIO 拉低将视频输入从 C1 切换到 C2。默认情况下 RELAY3 "
"配置用于控制此引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:133
#: f39563ab0da74accbfb915fee907d50e
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:134
#: a6fd6368e8c14c49a26724511adf7e05
msgid ""
"The TBS Lucid H7 Wing does not come with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed. "
"Use the instructions here to load ArduPilot the first time :ref:`common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`. Firmware for the TBS Lucid H7 "
"Wing can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in sub-folders "
"labeled “TBS_LUCID_H7_WING\"."
msgstr ""
"TBS Lucid H7 Wing 未预装 ArduPilot 固件。请使用此处说明首次加载 ArduPilot：:ref:`common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`。TBS Lucid H7 Wing 的固件可在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的子文件夹 「TBS_LUCID_H7_WING」 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:137
#: f2cd6653eb564362a4c532a04d8395ed
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过 DFU 完成：按住引导程序按钮插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:141
#: ce890149c3004d29a737fdcf11a6ad29
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
